      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261213">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261215">SSE2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261217">Return the bitwise logical AND NOT of packed double precision floating-point values in xmm1 and xmm2/mem. </para>
      </td>
